{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6001_p", "source_sha256": "74b296d2182e2b147ad37871cf006c8332e902c3eeccdde70793f56a05496088", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n莉緒は今、カメラマンさんと打ち合わせに……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的日子。\n莉绪现在正和摄影师商量拍摄的事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6002_046rio", "source_sha256": "4ecad15142b0616210d6f381b1c1848cf663c63686f7ea69ea8ec10bec35444c", "ja": "{$P$}く～ん、聞いてよ～！\nお姉さん、ちょっと困っちゃった。", "zh": "{$P$}君～，听我说嘛～！\n姐姐我有点伤脑筋了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6003_p", "source_sha256": "e52794d06adbd880876050cf52be1ed5ce75506134f542860d355772a2174cc3", "ja": "話は聞くけど、その前に打ち合わせはどうした。\nカメラマンさんに呼ばれてるんじゃなかったか？", "zh": "话我会听，不过在那之前，打合怎么样了？\n摄影师不是在找你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6004_046rio", "source_sha256": "a718c27cd41d0487b8ab36fdcc87fc2294c9cce0cd6f8c2b659842ef84b9ce3d", "ja": "そう、それ。それなのよ！\nカメラマンさんのところに行ってきたんだけど……。", "zh": "对，就是那个！我说的就是这个！\n我刚去过摄影师那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6005_046rio", "source_sha256": "268b09b72d443238456469868e4445941e70de91d2bdf91cca67de48cf4ad848", "ja": "「今日はクール路線でどうですか？」って言われたの。\nでも私は、セクシーでプランを考えてたから……。", "zh": "对方问我“今天走帅气路线怎么样？”。\n可是我之前考虑的方案是走性感路线，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6006_p", "source_sha256": "23499117e3f882d71dd90a557d9b66ee569412b73711c812433b5df559297c6f", "ja": "なるほどな。莉緒ならどっちもいけそうだけど……。\nその様子だと、決めかねてるって感じか？", "zh": "原来如此。莉绪的话，感觉不管哪种风格都能驾驭……  \n看你这样子，是还没决定好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6007_046rio", "source_sha256": "b92b26dac128a4df11a92ca7e0228e9ab5aacd566ae02eeb7d447c020c5ed510", "ja": "うん……。ヒョウの衣装を着るって聞いてたから、\nたくさんセクシーなポーズを考えたのよ。", "zh": "嗯……因为听说要穿豹纹服装，\n我还想了好多性感的姿势呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6008_046rio", "source_sha256": "89bb7c5e82e7089811688a4473923edd52ae6b6d30a518b8335f8297589c583a", "ja": "もちろん、お仕事だしそういう指示なら従うけど……\n{$P$}くん、どう思う？", "zh": "当然，如果是工作，而且是那样的指示，我会服从的，不过……\n{$P$}，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6009", "source_sha256": "3cea95b13bbee129becbfaedb25063137cfb1e4820b67209a76c450463d9b667", "ja": "両方", "zh": "两者", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
