{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6011", "source_sha256": "5c86b9605c25bded2e0e79d689925d9982ea1cd002052b27a7d841e4d93e29be", "ja": "クール", "zh": "冷酷系", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6100_p", "source_sha256": "e948c93038bc0619e5924a8bb1942f341c44b2e99835f29c4682c518bbdbee45", "ja": "正直、どちらも捨てがたいな。莉緒なら、\nクールとセクシー、両方表現できるんじゃないか？", "zh": "说实话，两个都很难割舍啊。莉绪的话，应该能同时展现出冷酷和性感吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6101_046rio", "source_sha256": "229129aa5070c8e24829cbbe91773333947f57a8c5719ef9bf691b5043e62353", "ja": "両方ね……。カメラマンさんも、どちらかひとつだけ\nって言ってたわけじゃないし……。", "zh": "两种啊……摄影师也没说只能选其中一种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6102_046rio", "source_sha256": "983081ef851b4db1d2fe450f31021f0c1b9aefc5fb9621d4b7115901381c9494", "ja": "ふふ、いいじゃない！　クールでセクシーなお姉さんの\n本気……見せてア・ゲ・ル♪", "zh": "呵呵，这不是很好嘛！就让你们见识一下冷酷又性感的大姐姐的认真……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6200_p", "source_sha256": "9373802634c0e0f275c0b14a1466587fe24dd5ba06640e7266ba3d33b71ebe00", "ja": "ここは、莉緒の考えてきた方でいこう。\nファンの人達もきっと、喜んでくれると思うよ。", "zh": "这里就按莉绪想好的方案来吧。粉丝们肯定也会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6201_046rio", "source_sha256": "1468f8376382af6b34630a6a4d70ba3fe510d8c2f883efbf30baa39592e99807", "ja": "そうよね……そうよね！　やっぱりみんな、\nお姉さんのセクシーな姿を期待してるわよね！", "zh": "是啊……没错！大家果然都期待着大姐姐性感的模样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6202_046rio", "source_sha256": "6829a37bee34a1cdd568eb292238dac71aa4f628244dd7dd1ac1d777d29bacfd", "ja": "それじゃ、早速カメラマンさんに相談しないと。\n{$P$}くん、楽しみにしててね♪", "zh": "那就得赶紧去跟摄影师商量了。{$P$}，敬请期待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6300_p", "source_sha256": "feabe2a533f08c3041ceb52fdd778f852b8448b64c8b99aa80a5e2c8fffc3de1", "ja": "ファンの人達も色々な莉緒を見たいかもしれないしな。\nクール系でギャップを見せるのもいいと思うぞ。", "zh": "粉丝们或许也想看到莉绪不同的一面吧。\n走酷飒路线展现反差，我觉得也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6301_046rio", "source_sha256": "48ca83c8bd61e97f364c56cbf0be7555bd27629489c5fbad234d9e1fe4d1c73d", "ja": "うーん、そうね。セクシーばかりも飽きちゃうわよね。\nけど、クールなヒョウってどうすればいいのかしら？", "zh": "嗯——是啊。总是走性感路线也会让人腻吧。\n可是，冷酷系的豹子要怎么演才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_6302_046rio", "source_sha256": "fee4c67ebfc8a1f4dbf8e140c9ed23cb8094fc4b98b4ae402cc68d6a4ea6d07c", "ja": "普通にしてても、自然とセクシーが出ちゃうし……。\nはぁ～……セクシーすぎるのも考えものね。", "zh": "就算我只是普通地站着，性感也会自然流露出来……。\n唉～……太性感了也是个烦恼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
